raph of the function has a horizontal tangent line at $x=0,$ and therefore, ${f}^{′}(0)=0.$\n\n- Statement “$f(x)$ has a local minimum at $x=1$” is true. The function has a local minimum at $x=1$ since $f(1)\\le f(x)$ for all $x$ close enough to $x=1.$\n\nTherefore, all three statements are true." :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186729512 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238006} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 28.62 :task-item/id #uuid "150a4d42-836a-4fb1-b42b-b6e9964659ec" :task-item/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186729513} :task-item/responses [{:answer/id #uuid "d2a8359a-378f-5d30-b9c0-f8c4d4fb9c4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461280} {:answer/id #uuid "7d3f2ac5-9e21-5c73-81bb-3e709f16ae1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461282} {:answer/id #uuid "9d12003a-0d3f-510e-b2aa-cfbebcab6a56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461284}] :task-item/status {:db/ident :task-item.status/correct} :task-item/working-ended-at #inst "2026-10-28T16:44:41.374Z"}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238008 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064162 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a595bc07-ad64-537d-be42-06144814b97d" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Extrema of a Function Given Its Graph"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e7e0e77b-9362-5d68-9555-2154d5f51bdb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730123} {:answer/id #uuid "1ad593b2-39a4-5815-9cf9-18349403a45f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730124}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1ad593b2-39a4-5815-9cf9-18349403a45f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730124} :answer-field/id #uuid "23d73d4a-c89d-5c76-ae7c-60674b43b0d4" :answer-field/key "$f(