swer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730187} :answer-field/id #uuid "208ce18b-f34f-5cb0-a724-e73a356ef120" :answer-field/key "$x=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730223} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e6b96cc-a069-501f-b7d8-bd1c3c3e45d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730189} {:answer/id #uuid "8676bafc-1fe7-5f53-ba4b-0e1bb5d4f069" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730190}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e6b96cc-a069-501f-b7d8-bd1c3c3e45d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730189} :answer-field/id #uuid "14341a8c-ff25-5a8f-867e-f567f25c9e67" :answer-field/key "$x=6$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730224}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3747ead0-6028-5b33-a0a9-4b842fbf83b2" :question/math-academy-id "q-73401" :question/problem "![](images/48/48569328379c72215884b759687c7c40ced06f9864d05d2638e4389694f90630.png)\n\nThe graph of $y=f(x)$ is plotted above. What are the $x$-coordinates of the stationary points?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A stationary point of $f(x)$ is the value of $x$ where ${f}^{′}(x)=0.$ Graphically, those are the values where the tangent to the graph is horizontal.\n\nIn the given graph, we can see that at $x=0,$ the tangent to the graph is horizontal, so we have ${f}^{′}(0)=0.$\n\n![](images/57/576d25a420f1f4ebcbd0e9b055d7a27159caa8f1721ff5f35a32b86c3e3a0fb3.png)\n\n  \n\nTherefore, there is only one stationary point, and its $x$-coordinate is $x=0.$\n\n**Note:** At $x=2$, there is a sharp corner, so ${f}^{′}(2)$ doesn't exist. This gives one more critical point. But this is not a stationary point." :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186729422 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186341965} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 21.574 :task-item/id #uuid "069e03e8-6fd5-4015-81a8-2af125dcd7df" :task-item/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186729440} :task-item/responses [{:answer/id #uuid "dcfd30d3-14b5-5996-998b-c1872bb0c6e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730186} {:answer/id #uuid "51943cb0-ca0c-5a9e-8a1b-ba42d41664a7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730187} {:answer/id #uuid "3e6b96cc-a069-501f-b7d8-bd1c3c3e45d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186730189}] :task-item/status {:db/ident :task-item.status/correct} :task-item/working-ended-at #inst "2026-10-28T16:40:26.086Z"}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186402902 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064162 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a595bc07-ad64-537d-be42-06144814b97d" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Extrema of a Function Given Its Graph"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4d23575-4aa4-50b3-8f45-fa5b80561dfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473154} {:answer/id #uuid "ed8e14b7-e1aa-5f72-99fe-d0d63eed18da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473155}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4d23575-4aa4-50b3-8f45-fa5b80561dfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473154} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f3e8587-e9da-5d96-9590-a8b34259c744" :answer-field/key "Point $A$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473972} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "da106867-9f71-5223-9c5f-fb348c0ba25f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473156} {:answer/id #uuid "18fa81c5-1bb2-5ca5-b7a9-e4e88f535b6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/tex